SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- SN Javateas (21R) -- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating start location\, not a school\n• A p
 redetermined route\n• 25+/- mile routes\n• 13 to 15 and 15 to 17 mph a
 verage pace\n• Usually no sweep\n• “short” stop for refreshment/co
 ffee mid-route at [Javateas](https://javateas.com/)\nThe CoffeeTue rides a
 re social rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cycl
 ists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be supportive of the
  other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back
  of the last group.\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](https://routes.lancasterb
 ikeclub.net/cue/sn-javateas-21r/)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. P
 lease bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/
 CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we 
 require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBe
 ing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www
 .lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RS
 VP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lanc
 bikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=
 323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conte
 nt.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](h
 ttps://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
