SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Wallace Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Cue and GPX link:** [Phil's Hills: Wallace Repeats](https://ridewithgps.co
 m/routes/54353187)\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total dista
 nce of approximately **15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circui
 t featuring **1-2 climbing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize mainta
 ining a consistent climbing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and 
 repeating the effort to build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll mai
 ntain a comfortable average pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Poli
 cy:** You'll never be left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure ev
 eryone stays together.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds o
 r audible music-playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair k
 it (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
