DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n## Details\n\nRide Leader
 : Bruce Black\n\nAn enjoyable ride around Lititz with very little climbing
 . We will stop at Greco's for ice cream. The pace will be 8 to 10 mph aver
 age. Multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5).\n\nThis ride is a social ride\
 , but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal a
 t their own comfortable paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists 
