 up.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\n[https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54926
 355?privacy_code=rcQ7P7BONkSG7Me12CTVUrKgYse65ZnK](https://ridewithgps.com
 /routes/54926355?privacy_code=rcQ7P7BONkSG7Me12CTVUrKgYse65ZnK)\n\nHelmets
  are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and a basic
  repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetu
